-“Tuc de Molières (o Mulleres) des de l’Espitau de Vielha / Boca Sud del Túnel de Vielha (en record de Juan Monroy)” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-alpinisme/tuc-de-molieres-o-mulleres-des-de-lespitau-de-vielha-boca-sud-del-tunel-de-vielha-en-record-de-juan-198729712', '{"en":"This demanding 21.1 km loop starts from the village of Bausen in Val d''Aran, offering 1635 m of elevation gain. The route traverses panoramic, grassy border ridges, summiting Tuc des Tres Corets (1952m), Cap d’Estanhs (2084m), Tuc deth Plan der Òme (2194m), and Pic de Sahaja (2163m).\n\nThe trail winds through splendid beech forests like Bosc de Carlac and Bosquet de Saplan. A particularly adventurous section without a defined path descends through Coma and Carena de Lauadors, requiring good route-finding skills. It''s a long, challenging day for experienced hikers.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular de 21,1 km comença des del poble de Bausen a la Vall d''Aran, amb 1635 m de desnivell positiu. La ruta recorre panoràmiques i suaus carenes herbades frontereres, assolint els cims del Tuc des Tres Corets (1952m), Cap d’Estanhs (2084m), Tuc deth Plan der Òme (2194m) i Pic de Sahaja (2163m).\n\nEl sender s''endinsa per esplèndides fagedes com el Bosc de Carlac i el Bosquet de Saplan. Un tram particularment aventurer i sense camí definit baixa per la Coma i Carena de Lauadors, requerint bones habilitats d''orientació. És una jornada llarga i desafiadora per a excursionistes experimentats.","es":"Esta exigente ruta circular de 21,1 km comienza desde el pueblo de Bausen en la Val d''Aran, con 1635 m de desnivel positivo. La ruta recorre panorámicas y suaves carenas herbadas fronterizas, alcanzando las cumbres del Tuc des Tres Corets (1952m), Cap d’Estanhs (2084m), Tuc deth Plan der Òme (2194m) y Pic de Sahaja (2163m).\n\nEl sendero se adentra por espléndidos hayedos como el Bosc de Carlac y el Bosquet de Saplan. Un tramo particularmente aventurero y sin camino definido desciende por la Coma y Carena de Lauadors, requiriendo buenas habilidades de orientación. Es una jornada larga y desafiante para excursionistas experimentados."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 21115, 1635, 1635, 2191, 894, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, 29880, 2078, '2018-09-30', '2018-07', '[{"lat":42.834285,"lng":0.717835,"ele":894.7},{"lat":42.834259,"lng":0.717822,"ele":893.6},{"lat":42.8343,"lng":0.717737,"ele":895.3},{"lat":42.834316,"lng":0.717706,"ele":895.9},{"lat":42.834351,"lng":0.717514,"ele":897},{"lat":42.834388,"lng":0.717311,"ele":898.2},{"lat":42.834386,"lng":0.717101,"ele":897.9},{"lat":42.834384,"lng":0.716988,"ele":897.6},{"lat":42.834387,"lng":0.716906,"ele":897.5},{"lat":42.834425,"lng":0.716761,"ele":898.5},{"lat":42.834431,"lng":0.716651,"ele":898.5},{"lat":42.834433,"lng":0.716626,"ele":898.4},{"lat":42.834499,"lng":0.716395,"ele":899},{"lat":42.834539,"lng":0.716096,"ele":897.6},{"lat":42.83457,"lng":0.715983,"ele":897.7},{"lat":42.834593,"lng":0.715815,"ele":897.1},{"lat":42.834592,"lng":0.715793,"ele":896.9},{"lat":42.834681,"lng":0.71583,"ele":899.8},{"lat":42.834787,"lng":0.715818,"ele":903},{"lat":42.834877,"lng":0.715876,"ele":906.4},{"lat":42.835024,"lng":0.715999,"ele":912.8},{"lat":42.835083,"lng":0.715998,"ele":915.4},{"lat":42.83517,"lng":0.716028,"ele":919.4},{"lat":42.835205,"lng":0.715937,"ele":920},{"lat":42.835213,"lng":0.715927,"ele":920.2},{"lat":42.835276,"lng":0.715782,"ele":921.9},{"lat":42.835306,"lng":0.71554,"ele":923.4},{"lat":42.835306,"lng":0.715478,"ele":923.1},{"lat":42.835374,"lng":0.715387,"ele":926},{"lat":42.835375,"lng":0.71533,"ele":925.8},{"lat":42.835347,"lng":0.715294,"ele":924.3},{"lat":42.835345,"lng":0.71511,"ele":924.3},{"lat":42.835358,"lng":0.714909,"ele":925.4},{"lat":42.835361,"lng":0.714702,"ele":926.2},{"lat":42.835358,"lng":0.714688,"ele":926.1},{"lat":42.835385,"lng":0.714578,"ele":927.7},{"lat":42.835431,"lng":0.714411,"ele":930.2},{"lat":42.835463,"lng":0.714302,"ele":931.8},{"lat":42.835558,"lng":0.714192,"ele":936.1},{"lat":42.835661,"lng":0.714039,"ele":941.1},{"lat":42.835714,"lng":0.713915,"ele":943.9},{"lat":42.8358,"lng":0.713728,"ele":947.9},{"l