es.wikiloc.com/rutas-senderismo/ciuret-cims-puig-de-lobric-i-puig-grillat-gorgs-el-toll-i-gorg-del-pou-faig-de-can-font-i-rasos-de-118637468', '{"en":"This moderate 14.1 km loop with 725 m of elevation gain starts from Saderra, passing the Saderra manor and Sant Marcel church. The route ascends the wooded Empriu Ridge to Punta Reia (952m), followed by an adventurous ridge section with easy equipped parts and some scrambling.\n\nThe trail continues to Collet de les Gargantes, then climbs the classic Baga Ridge to the panoramic Bellmunt Sanctuary (1248m). The descent traverses the beech forests of Bosc de la M.ª de Déu and Bosc de les Fages, passes the abundant Font Viva, and follows the old Camí de les Gargantes back to Saderra.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 14.1 km amb 725 m de desnivell positiu comença a Saderra, passant pel casal de Saderra i l''església de Sant Marcel. La ruta remunta l''emboscada Carena de l''Empriu fins a la Punta Reia (952m), seguida d''un tram de carena-cresta aventurer amb trams equipats fàcils i alguna grimpada.\n\nEl camí continua fins al Collet de les Gargantes, per després pujar per la clàssica Carena de la Baga fins al panoràmic Santuari de Bellmunt (1248m). La baixada travessa les fagedes del Bosc de la M.ª de Déu i del Bosc de les Fages, passa per la sempre abundant Font Viva i segueix el vell Camí de les Gargantes de tornada a Saderra.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 14.1 km con 725 m de desnivel positivo comienza en Saderra, pasando por el casal de Saderra y la iglesia de Sant Marcel. La ruta asciende por la boscosa Carena de l''Empriu hasta la Punta Reia (952m), seguida de un tramo de cresta aventurero con secciones equipadas fáciles y alguna trepada.\n\nEl sendero continúa hasta el Collet de les Gargantes, para luego subir por la clásica Carena de la Baga hasta el panorámico Santuario de Bellmunt (1248m). El descenso atraviesa los hayedos del Bosc de la M.ª de Déu y del Bosc de les Fages, pasa por la siempre abundante Font Viva y sigue el antiguo Camí de les Gargantes de regreso a Saderra."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 14098, 725, 725, 1243, 592, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 21720, 1307, '2019-01-27', '2018-08', '[{"lat":42.084524,"lng":2.2386,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.084524,"lng":2.238526,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.08454,"lng":2.238444,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.084548,"lng":2.2383,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.084552,"lng":2.238246,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.084567,"lng":2.238151,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.08458,"lng":2.238186,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.084596,"lng":2.238241,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.084602,"lng":2.238257,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.084607,"lng":2.238271,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.084623,"lng":2.238294,"ele":593.7},{"lat":42.084643,"lng":2.23834,"ele":594.7},{"lat":42.084679,"lng":2.238436,"ele":595.1},{"lat":42.084724,"lng":2.238568,"ele":595.1},{"lat":42.084729,"lng":2.238637,"ele":595.1},{"lat":42.084742,"lng":2.238753,"ele":595.6},{"lat":42.084732,"lng":2.238851,"ele":595.6},{"lat":42.08473,"lng":2.238869,"ele":595.6},{"lat":42.084738,"lng":2.239123,"ele":597.1},{"lat":42.084797,"lng":2.239375,"ele":598},{"lat":42.084855,"lng":2.239685,"ele":598.5},{"lat":42.084878,"lng":2.23987,"ele":599},{"lat":42.084878,"lng":2.239893,"ele":599},{"lat":42.084881,"lng":2.239912,"ele":599.5},{"lat":42.084884,"lng":2.239931,"ele":599.5},{"lat":42.084888,"lng":2.239946,"ele":600},{"lat":42.084893,"lng":2.239965,"ele":599.5},{"lat":42.084896,"lng":2.239984,"ele":599.5},{"lat":42.0849,"lng":2.240002,"ele":600},{"lat":42.084924,"lng":2.240102,"ele":600.4},{"lat":42.084959,"lng":2.240361,"ele":601.4},{"lat":42.085,"lng":2.240501,"ele":602.4},{"lat":42.085038,"lng":2.240553,"ele":602.8},{"lat":42.085052,"lng":2.240544,"ele":602.8},{"lat":42.085069,"lng":2.240522,"ele":602.8},{"lat":42.085177,"lng":2.240472,"ele":604.8},{"lat":42.085418,"lng":2.240351,"ele":606.2},{"lat":42.085436,"lng":2.240322,"ele":606.2},{"lat":42.085482,"lng":2.240224,"ele":606.2},{"lat":42.08555,"lng":2.240156,"ele":607.2},{"lat":42.085578,"lng":2.24