('wikiloc', '32689476', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/els-angels-santuari-de-la-mare-de-deu-montigalar-2x100-cims-feec-1x100-cim-icgc-ibp-74-hkg-31-01-20-32689476', 'Els Àngels - Montigalar [2x100 Peaks FEEC/1 Peak ICGC] - The Witches'' Balcony - Can Llach Mill/Lock - [IBP74HKG] - [31.01.2019]', '{"en":"Montigalar and Witches'' Balcony loop","ca":"Circular Montigalar i Balcó de les Bruixes","es":"Circular Montigalar y Balcón de las Brujas"}'::jsonb, 'Els Àngels - Montigalar [2x100 Cims FEEC/1 Cim ICGC] -El Balcó de les Bruixes -Molí/Esclusa Can Llach-[IBP74HKG]-[31.01.2019] Hiking trail in Vilers, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. RUTA GRABADA CON GARMIN ETREX 30X Y VERIFICADA CON BASECAMP :  
 
