-“Roca Sareny, Montcau i Cortins pel Castell Pera, Emprius, Queixal Corcat, Agulles de Finestrelles, Coves (8) i Canal del Llor” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/roca-sareny-montcau-i-cortins-pel-castell-pera-emprius-queixal-corcat-agulles-de-finestrelles-coves-206095146', '{"en":"This 11.8 km moderate loop starts from the new church of Sant Pere i Sant Fermí in Rellinars, offering a varied hike with 464m of elevation gain. The trail follows a well-trodden path past the interesting troglodytic dwelling of Bauma de l’Endaló and leads to the Fonts de Rellinars, continuing near the Riera de Rellinars.\n\nAlong the way, you''ll pass three more springs and can optionally explore the Cova de la Pedregosa, which has an adventurous access. The route includes an optional ascent to the panoramic Castell de Bocs (662m), involving some scrambling (Iº-Iº+). The return follows a section of the Camí Ral and descends via the Carena de La Trona.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada d''11.8 km s''inicia des de l''església nova de Sant Pere i Sant Fermí de Rellinars, oferint una caminada variada amb 464m de desnivell positiu. El camí segueix un sender transitat que passa per l''interessant habitatge troglodític de la Bauma de l’Endaló i condueix a les Fonts de Rellinars, continuant a prop de la Riera de Rellinars.\n\nAl llarg del recorregut, passareu per tres fonts més i podreu explorar opcionalment la Cova de la Pedregosa, amb un accés aventurer. La ruta inclou una pujada opcional al panoràmic Castell de Bocs (662m), que implica algunes grimpades (Iº-Iº+). El retorn segueix un tram del Camí Ral i baixa per la Carena de La Trona.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 11.8 km se inicia desde la iglesia nueva de Sant Pere i Sant Fermí de Rellinars, ofreciendo una caminata variada con 464m de desnivel positivo. El sendero sigue un camino transitado que pasa por la interesante vivienda troglodítica de la Bauma de l’Endaló y conduce a las Fonts de Rellinars, continuando cerca de la Riera de Rellinars.\n\nA lo largo del recorrido, pasaréis por tres fuentes más y podréis explorar opcionalmente la Cova de la Pedregosa, con un acceso aventurero. La ruta incluye una subida opcional al panorámico Castell de Bocs (662m), que implica algunas trepadas (Iº-Iº+). El regreso sigue un tramo del Camí Ral y desciende por la Carena de La Trona."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 11796, 464, 464, 668, 322, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 18180, 1025, '2019-02-04', '2018-03', '[{"lat":41.639917,"lng":1.911224,"ele":324.3},{"lat":41.639898,"lng":1.911284,"ele":324.4},{"lat":41.639954,"lng":1.911391,"ele":325.5},{"lat":41.640028,"lng":1.911494,"ele":326},{"lat":41.640051,"lng":1.911592,"ele":326.3},{"lat":41.63995,"lng":1.9117,"ele":327.6},{"lat":41.639789,"lng":1.911741,"ele":325.4},{"lat":41.639724,"lng":1.911838,"ele":324.6},{"lat":41.639615,"lng":1.912005,"ele":321.9},{"lat":41.639539,"lng":1.912292,"ele":322.1},{"lat":41.639514,"lng":1.912448,"ele":323.2},{"lat":41.639478,"lng":1.912724,"ele":326.9},{"lat":41.639477,"lng":1.912722,"ele":326.8},{"lat":41.639405,"lng":1.912902,"ele":328.1},{"lat":41.639292,"lng":1.913111,"ele":328.1},{"lat":41.63925,"lng":1.913182,"ele":328.3},{"lat":41.639083,"lng":1.913283,"ele":328.2},{"lat":41.638935,"lng":1.91339,"ele":329.8},{"lat":41.638811,"lng":1.913468,"ele":332.1},{"lat":41.638798,"lng":1.91347,"ele":332.3},{"lat":41.638766,"lng":1.91347,"ele":332.6},{"lat":41.638584,"lng":1.913501,"ele":334.6},{"lat":41.638432,"lng":1.913543,"ele":336.2},{"lat":41.638378,"lng":1.913558,"ele":336.8},{"lat":41.638189,"lng":1.913566,"ele":338.1},{"lat":41.638062,"lng":1.913537,"ele":338.4},{"lat":41.63794,"lng":1.913514,"ele":338},{"lat":41.637767,"lng":1.913568,"ele":339.2},{"lat":41.637735,"lng":1.913585,"ele":339.4},{"lat":41.637676,"lng":1.913626,"ele":340},{"lat":41.637526,"lng":1.913671,"ele":340.6},{"lat":41.637442,"lng":1.913698,"ele":340.2},{"lat":41.637303,"lng":1.913799,"ele":339.9},{"lat":41.637153,"lng":1.913916,"ele":339.5},{"lat":41.637034,"lng":1.91405,"ele":339.6},{"lat":41.63699,"lng":1.914156,"ele":340},{"lat":41.636963,"lng":1.914289,"ele":340.4},{"lat":41.63692,