('wikiloc', '3707582', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/diposits-la-mola-montcau-3707582', 'Diposits - La Mola - Montcau', '{"en":"Easy loop from Diposits to La Mola","ca":"Circular fàcil de Diposits a la Mola","es":"Circular fácil de Diposits a La Mola"}'::jsonb, 'Diposits-La Mola-Montcau Hiking trail in Matadepera, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Una pasejada que no per tradicional deixa de ser molt recomanable sobretot en dies clars, on podem veure unes magnífiques vistes de Barcelona, Montserrat, El Montseny, El Bages i fins i tot el Pirineu desde El Canigó fins El Pirineu mes Occidental.', '{"en":"This easy 14.1 km loop with 686 m of elevation gain offers a classic and highly recommended walk to La Mola and Montcau. Starting from Dipòsits, it''s particularly enjoyable on clear days for its extensive panoramic views.\n\nThe route provides magnificent vistas of Barcelona, Montserrat, El Montseny, El Bages, and even the Pyrenees. It''s a straightforward path suitable for those looking for a scenic day out without extreme technical difficulty.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 14,1 km amb 686 m de desnivell positiu ofereix una passejada clàssica i molt recomanable a la Mola i el Montcau. Començant des dels Dipòsits, és especialment agradable en dies clars per les seves extenses vistes panoràmiques.\n\nLa ruta proporciona magnífiques vistes de Barcelona, Montserrat, el Montseny, el Bages i fins i tot el Pirineu. És un camí senzill adequat per a aquells que busquen una jornada escènica sense dificultats tècniques extremes.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 14,1 km con 686 m de desnivel positivo ofrece un paseo clásico y muy recomendable a La Mola y el Montcau. Comenzando desde los Dipòsits, es especialmente agradable en días claros por sus extensas vistas panorámicas.\n\nLa ruta proporciona magníficas vistas de Barcelona, Montserrat, El Montseny, El Bages e incluso el Pirineo. Es un camino sencillo adecuado para aquellos que buscan una jornada escénica sin dificultades técnicas extremas."}'::jsonb, 'orso46', 14146, 686, 686, 1097, 727, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 13800, 905, '2012-12-08', '2012-11', '[{"lat":41.62749,"lng":2.021213,"ele":754.7},{"lat":41.627496,"lng":2.02121,"ele":754.8},{"lat":41.627629,"lng":2.021159,"ele":759},{"lat":41.62781,"lng":2.021022,"ele":765.4},{"lat":41.627918,"lng":2.020878,"ele":770.3},{"lat":41.627924,"lng":2.020866,"ele":770.7},{"lat":41.627987,"lng":2.02081,"ele":773.9},{"lat":41.628036,"lng":2.020721,"ele":777.2},{"lat":41.628154,"lng":2.020688,"ele":783.1},{"lat":41.628209,"lng":2.020679,"ele":785.8},{"lat":41.62822,"lng":2.020661,"ele":786.9},{"lat":41.628297,"lng":2.020582,"ele":793.1},{"lat":41.628369,"lng":2.020555,"ele":797.2},{"lat":41.628418,"lng":2.020555,"ele":798.8},{"lat":41.628511,"lng":2.020622,"ele":798.9},{"lat":41.628636,"lng":2.020575,"ele":804.9},{"lat":41.628753,"lng":2.02058,"ele":808.1},{"lat":41.628887,"lng":2.0206,"ele":810.7},{"lat":41.628978,"lng":2.020527,"ele":817.5},{"lat":41.629101,"lng":2.020487,"ele":822.8},{"lat":41.629181,"lng":2.020565,"ele":820.8},{"lat":41.629371,"lng":2.020616,"ele":823.7},{"lat":41.629563,"lng":2.020732,"ele":821.8},{"lat":41.629702,"lng":2.020689,"ele":827.9},{"lat":41.629714,"lng":2.020628,"ele":832.6},{"lat":41.629663,"lng":2.020583,"ele":834.4},{"lat":41.629704,"lng":2.020531,"ele":838.6},{"lat":41.629675,"lng":2.020432,"ele":842.3},{"lat":41.629652,"lng":2.020395,"ele":843.3},{"lat":41.629592,"lng":2.020366,"ele":842.8},{"lat":41.629554,"lng":2.020362,"ele":841.8},{"lat":41.629504,"lng":2.020411,"ele":838.1},{"lat":41.629456,"lng":2.020384,"ele":837.8},{"lat":41.629459,"lng":2.020337,"ele":839.9},{"lat":41.62942,"lng":2.020191,"ele":845.8},{"lat":41.629378,"lng":2.020178,"ele":845.3},{"lat":41.629361,"lng":2.020173,"ele":845.1},{"lat":41.629314,"lng":2.020132,"ele":845.8},{"lat":41.629249,"lng":2.020099,"ele":845.4},{"lat":41.629205,"lng":2.020026,"ele":847.2},{"lat":41.629112,"lng"